### Add an activity
POST {{host}}/trips/{{tripId}}/itinerary
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "22222222-2222-4222-8222-222222222221",
  "dayDate": "2026-11-20",
  "startTime": "10:00",
  "endTime": "11:25",
  "title": "Pantai Kuta",
  "category": "ATTRACTION",
  "sortOrder": 1.0
}

### Unscheduled place (e.g. from Explore)
POST {{host}}/trips/{{tripId}}/itinerary
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "22222222-2222-4222-8222-222222222222",
  "title": "Tanah Lot",
  "category": "ATTRACTION",
  "durationMin": 90,
  "source": "AI"
}

### List (unscheduled first, then by day and sortOrder)
GET {{host}}/trips/{{tripId}}/itinerary

### Schedule / replace
PUT {{host}}/trips/{{tripId}}/itinerary/22222222-2222-4222-8222-222222222222
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "22222222-2222-4222-8222-222222222222",
  "dayDate": "2026-11-21",
  "startTime": "09:00",
  "endTime": "10:30",
  "title": "Tanah Lot",
  "category": "ATTRACTION",
  "durationMin": 90,
  "source": "AI",
  "sortOrder": 1.0
}

### Save the order + times of one day (returns that day's items)
PUT {{host}}/trips/{{tripId}}/days/2026-11-20/order
Content-Type: application/json

{ "items": [ { "id": "22222222-2222-4222-8222-222222222221", "sortOrder": 1.0, "startTime": "10:00", "endTime": "11:25" } ] }

### Delete (soft)
DELETE {{host}}/trips/{{tripId}}/itinerary/22222222-2222-4222-8222-222222222221
